Z||000006||sparks||04-09-2001||09:51 PM||||Hah, I've  a friend who emailed me the URL for Jp Magazine, in this months issue they mention the Jalapeno being in Kit Car since it makes the care "Jeep-like".  They said they figured it was the closest thing to the Jeepster concept vehicle from a couple years back you'd probably ever get.  Then they made sure to mention that this would be the first, last and only time a Fiero was mentioned in a Jeep magazine.<P>I kinda like the Jalapeno, but then I have a thing for round headlights and 7 slot grills too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR>Adam Sparks||||reg||10
